00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.650 line:8%
Everyone is selling you a piece of AI.

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:04.300 line:8%
Where do you start?

00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:06.420
Your company runs in pieces.

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:08.430
A customer writes to one person.

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:10.000
The plan sits with another.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:11.750
You chase the whole story.

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:13.300
And things slip.

00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:15.870
Start with your company.

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:19.680
HAI Seed gives your whole company
its own AI.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:21.850 line:8%
Most AI knows the world.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.450 line:8%
HAI makes one that knows your company.

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:27.000 line:8%
The world’s best AI, plus your business.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.760
It starts as a seed,
planted in your company.

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:34.500
It discovers your business, learns
your rules, and turns it all into answers.

00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:38.500
Day by day, it becomes
your company’s own AI foundation.

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:42.500 line:8%
HAI’s first big job isn’t a chat.

00:00:42.740 --> 00:00:44.730 line:8%
It’s a full company audit.

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:48.440
It reads everything you choose to connect,
then looks at the whole business,

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:52.160
through the eyes of finance, sales,
operations and customers.

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:55.400
It connects who said what,
and what changed.

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:58.020
It checks each promise
against the records.

00:00:58.020 --> 00:01:01.950
It shows what’s wrong,
where it found it, and how to fix it.

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:04.420
That’s one finding.

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:06.150
There are more.

00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:08.730
Each fix arrives prepared.

00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:11.220
You review, you decide.

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:12.320
Your team acts.

00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:14.930
And it doesn’t stop there.

00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:17.270
The checks you agree on keep running.

00:01:18.020 --> 00:01:19.610
HAI reports on its own.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:22.000
When a task keeps coming back,

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:24.450
HAI offers to build an agent
in a few minutes.

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:29.200
Whatever you build on this foundation
already knows your company.

00:01:29.540 --> 00:01:31.150 line:8%
Then bring in your teams.

00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:34.900 line:8%
Sales, finance and operations
each ask their own questions.

00:01:35.140 --> 00:01:37.600 line:8%
You see what is happening,
without chasing it.

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:39.260
You can ask any time.

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:43.550
And the longer it works with you,
the more your company knows.

00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:46.120 line:8%
No more explaining your business
from scratch.

00:01:47.720 --> 00:01:49.590
Install it on a company computer.

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:52.490
Guided self-onboarding
connects your sources.

00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:54.000
Where do you start?

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:55.250
With your company.

00:01:55.720 --> 00:01:57.470
Bring one company question.

00:01:57.640 --> 00:01:59.670
We’ll answer it on your own records.

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:01.130
Request a demo.

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:03.980
HAI. Talk to your company.
